            "review_title": "Review at Khoi Pizza & coffee",
            "review_text": "Emily Phan\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam9 contributions\n0\nKHÓI Pizza\nMay 2019\nVery good KHÓI pizza, smooth and crispy cake with different flavors. I like the most salad here. Fresh vegetables, broccoli are slowly boiling water, just green, crispy, not live, generally tuna salad\nKHÓI Pizza has completely conquered Vietnamese tastes because of the special taste of pizza\nI loved the nice taste and i wish I will be back to eat again. Cute shopkeeper and enthusiastic service. The shop is not too noisy but there are many online orders\nRead more\nWritten July 20, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
